0,Gudanji - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gudanji,"Gudanji The Gudanji, otherwise known as the Kotandji or Ngandji, [1] are an indigenous Australian people of the Northern Territory.",Gudanji,Australian
1,Music of Australia - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Australia,"Music of Australia The music of Australia has an extensive history made of music societies. Indigenous Australian music forms a significant part of the unique heritage of a 40,000- to 60,000-year history which produced the iconic didgeridoo.",Gudanji,Australian
