6,AIATSIS AustLang Online,https://aiatsis.gov.au/austlang/language/c26,"Gudanji (C26) is one of three dialects including Binbinka N138 and Wambaya C19 of the Wambayan language group, which belongs to the Ngurlun sub-group in the Mirndi language family of non-Pama Nyungan languages (Harvey, 2008:1-3). Harvey says Gudanji (C26) is extremely endangered (2008:4). The Mirndi language family consists of two geographically non-contiguous groups on the Barkly Tableland in ...",Gudanji,Australian
